      <pattern name="Clean byte-author (authored path)" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/ComposeDocumentRenderer.cs">BuildRun:366 / AssembleParagraph:346 — the clean-authoring path (zero text-search, the cited I-5 exception). Emit w:hyperlink here for the authored href.</pattern>
      <pattern name="Tracked appliers" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/ComposeShadowPatchEngine.cs">ApplyInsertText:314 / WrapRunAsDeleted:942 — model the tracked hyperlink applier alongside these; surgical, (paraId,runIndex,offset)-anchored.</pattern>
      <pattern name="Closed op catalog (mirror)" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/Operations/ComposeOperation.cs">[JsonDerivedType] :148-157 (10 ops), ComposeMarkType:101 — extend with the hyperlink op + `link` mark; mirror in client compose-operations.ts :54-64.</pattern>
      <pattern name="R4 guard site (re-enable)" location="src/client/shared/Spaarke.Compose.Components/src/widgets/ComposeFormatToolbar.tsx">Hyperlink control disabled at :635 (both modes) — re-enable once both paths represent hyperlinks.</pattern>
      <pattern name="Client step classifier" location="src/client/shared/Spaarke.Compose.Components/src/widgets/stepOperationInterceptor.ts">classifyStep:442 — emit the hyperlink op (today unrepresentable/defer).</pattern>
